    {
      "type": "LinguisticObject",
      "content": "The work's own name for time that has stopped and been buried: \"Dead time. Hollow depression interred invalid / to resurgence, resistant to memory. Waits.\" (ELITERE). Time here is not a line that passes but a site to be excavated, which the Diseuse is called upon to break open.",
